{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46936","headline":"送禅者游南岳 · 齐己","name":"送禅者游南岳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽随南櫂去衡阳，谁住江边树下房。\n尘梦是非都觉了，野云心地更何妨。\n渐临瀑布听猨思，却背岣嵝有鴈行。\n想到中峰上层寺，石窗秋霁见潇湘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}